an help you! Especially with how to avoid specific monsters. \n","path":"/game/15373963274-underwater-company","slug":"15373963274-underwater-company","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a1a438cf9b960f93d6c3cff5260737d231e3f377edda2072c3d18bc87d41bf43.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5d579c1bda055c2ac2dfed82b6af8da5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":7097555,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-01-13T05:30:31.137Z","creator":{"name":"Underwater Company","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":961409234,"name":"Blood Moon Tycoon","desc":"New Infected Arsenal! 🔫 The Ruby Shop is finally expanding with powerful new Infected Weapons! Get your hands on these now and prepare for what's still to come...\n\nSuper Duper Yacht Update! 🛳️ Check out the new and improved Yacht now featuring Boats, new Weapons, a Luxury Hot Tub and more! ⚓\n\nBUILD and expand your massive base as you unlock new gear and upgrades! \n\nFIGHT off the undead and other survivors as you prepare for the dangers that come out at night! \n\nSURVIVE the challenging Blood Moons with, or without, other survivors and you will be rewarded! \n\nFollow me on Twitter for codes, update news & more!\nOr join my group https://www.roblox.com/Groups/Group.aspx?gid=3505518","path":"/game/961409234-blood-moon-tycoon","slug":"961409234-blood-moon-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/16d2a1ade395a072be56b6ff10840b38def236ecf2a33be78d5488a7d4ae72a2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dc0c0f3496b70d3cb8ebd6823a8aec24/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":122570589,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-24T10:57:32.002Z","creator":{"name":"LostGamez","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75203399886990,"name":"Mafia Clash","desc":"🔪Your family is at WAR! Four rival families are competing for control of your city's underworld. Whose side will you take? Will you be a simple grunt, rise through the ranks to become the boss, or fight them as a cop? 🔪\n\n⭐ CLAIM your COMMUNITY MEMBER role by joining the group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/35589408\n\n- 💰 Become the Boss and command real players to glory!\n- 🧑‍🏭 Climb the ranks of your family with over 11 unique classes!\n- ❤️ Steal and survive in a massive open world! \n- 👍 Enjoy the game? Leave a favorite and like to support the developers!\n\n💬Check out the Social Links below to learn more about our community!\n\n🏷️1930’s, Tommy gun, Shooter, Jail, Cops, Police, Heist, Robbery","path":"/game/75203399886990-mafia-clash","slug":"75203399886990-mafia-clash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d22ea00c833fe400cb3a0d380594937da94ad56bf7e10680e3368a9f5845ea23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30db657ecd7c7d218401566ebdf154a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":3019642,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-02T13:18:18.263Z","creator":{"name":"Mafia Clash Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11421782440,"name":"(Up-to-date) [399] Find the Toasties","desc":"Welcome to Find the Toasties, i guess. just uh go in and find and collect all the toasties and guess what? the best part about it is that you get a badge!!1! pretty cool ngl. yeah pretty much. Please note that while the game IS available on all Devices, some such as Console will have some collectables locked away due to roblox restrictions.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Update 20.13 -\n- Updated every accessible realm to have the most recent systems\n- Updated the donation board from 9000 to 10000\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCredits to DM DO KU RO for some songs used.","path":"/game/11421782440-find-the-toasties","slug":"11421782440-find-the-toasties","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/029a39faf86cb98c090728323e1cd92bba5ba0b471ad192fd915a9a815d1b7cc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e6672479f4bb32a6da38f5c9f9247144/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":19891893,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-29T01:00:00.039Z","creator":{"name":"PC-Head Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13171071365,"name":"FEEDING TRASH TO RICH PEOPLE TYCOON","desc":"","path":"/game/13171071365-feeding-trash-to-rich-people-tycoon","slug":"13171071365-feeding-trash-to-rich-people-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf7a4ae580d0243ac4715e64438bd7cefd5d933fcb475b50370d241b67bc17ec.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7f90f4efc0dc3d4b800702ed8443080d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-28T20:11:10.323Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12455816210,"name":"FREE ADMIN LAND","desc":"🛠️ WEEKLY UPDATES Check back regularly for new commands!\n👍 NEW ADMIN COMMAND once the game gets 67% LIKE RATING!\n\n💥 Welcome to FREE ADMIN LAND! Use powerful free admin commands such as :jail and :fling! Have fun with others and purchase more powerful admins to become the ultimate admin! 💥\n\n❓ The Prefix is :\n💬 Type :cmds to view all admin Commands!\n\n✨ Premium Benefits: Free Rainbow Lucky Block!\n\nHave fun, and thanks for playing! If you enjoyed, don't forget to 👍 Like, ⭐ Favorite and 🔔 Follow!","path":"/game/12455816210-free-admin-land","slug":"12455816210-free-admin-land","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/70264086fcd49da1c42a20802a48acaaef8aba187a4069d5f2253cd3561d2351.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c7814b8a4c6e8541beb09883a9eeed2b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":69922950,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T10:21:04.049Z","creator":{"name":"Banana Studios Something","type":"Group"},"script